#tr.en: @note{cf. @xref[t.6.1.01,t.6.1.01.79]{6.1.01.79}} I did not answer the curse uttered against me with a curse of my own. 
#etcsl: line-id=A.26.a13.41

#etcsl#cf cf. 6.1.01.79

A.26.a13.42. [aš₂]-e# gi-a-ŋu₁₀ aš₂ mu-un-gi#
#lem: aš[curse]; gi[turn]; aš[curse]; gi[turn]
#tr.en: My answering a curse would be answered with another curse. 
#etcsl: line-id=A.26.a13.42

@end proverb

